<https://purl.org/oquo-ofaire#CreditLevel>
        a                owl:Class ;
        rdfs:comment     "Possible credit level of an O'FAIRe question."@en ;
        rdfs:label       "O'FAIRe credit level"@en ;
        rdfs:subClassOf  QualityModel:OrdinalScaleItem ;
        obo:IAO_0000115  "Category of the ordinal scale of an O'FAIRe metric, corresponding to one of the possible numbers of credits that O'FAIRe can give to a question. Its rank is the number of credits, so that the categories of a scale are ordered from the lowest to the highest number of credits, and the quality values of the metric, which are the credits returned by O'FAIRe, correspond to the category with the same rank."@en .

