                         ] ;
        obo:IAO_0000115  "Does the ontology reuse standard and FAIR metadata vocabularies to describe its metadata? This metric corresponds to the O'FAIRe question I2Q7, which assesses FAIR principle I2. Its raw value is the number of credits obtained in the question, measured on an ordinal scale with the following levels: 0 (The ontology does not declare reusing standards metadata vocabularies to describe its metadata); 5 (The ontology declares reusing standards metadata vocabularies (more or less 'FAIR') to describe its metadata)."@en ;
