                           owl:onProperty     oquo:measuresCharacteristicPositively
                         ] ;
        obo:IAO_0000115  "Does the ontology provide a version-specific URI, and is this URI resolvable? This metric corresponds to the O'FAIRe question F1Q4, which assesses FAIR principle F1. Its raw value is the number of credits obtained in the question, measured on an ordinal scale with the following levels: 0 (Version URI is absent); 2 (Version URI is present but invalid); 4 (Version URI is present, valid but not resolvable); 9 (Version URI is present, valid and resolvable)."@en ;
