                         ] ;
        obo:IAO_0000115  "Is the ontology included in a specific community set or group? This metric corresponds to the O'FAIRe question R1.3Q2, which assesses FAIR principle R1.3. Its raw value is the number of credits obtained in the question, measured on an ordinal scale with the following levels: 0 (The ontology does not provide information about its community set or group); 10 (The ontology is included in one of this groups: \"WHEAT\", \"CROP\", \"INRAE\"); 15 (The ontology is included in the OBO library); 20 (The ontology is included in the OBO library and is part of the OBO Foundry)."@en ;
        obo:IAO_0000119  "O'FAIRe, https://github.com/agroportal/fairness/blob/master/doc/results/FAIR-questions.md"@en ;
        rdf1:acronym     "R1.3Q2" .

