        obo:IAO_0000115  "Does the ontology provide an additional \"external\" identifier, i.e., a guarantee globally unique and persistent identifier assigned by an accredited body? If yes, is the external identifier a DOI? This metric corresponds to the O'FAIRe question F1Q2, which assesses FAIR principle F1. Its raw value is the number of credits obtained in the question, measured on an ordinal scale with the following levels: 0 (External identifier is absent); 3 (External identifier is present but invalid); 6 (External identifier is present and valid); 9 (External identifier is an invalid DOI); 11 (External identifier is a valid DOI)."@en ;
        obo:IAO_0000119  "O'FAIRe, https://github.com/agroportal/fairness/blob/master/doc/results/FAIR-questions.md"@en ;
        rdf1:acronym     "F1Q2" .

