        rdfs:subClassOf  [ a                   owl:Restriction ;
                           owl:onProperty      oquo:measuresCharacteristicPositively ;
                           owl:someValuesFrom  oquo-fair-qm:F2Characteristic
                         ] ;
        obo:IAO_0000115  "Is the ontology described with additional 'MIRO should' or 'optional' metadata properties? This metric corresponds to the O'FAIRe question F2Q2, which assesses FAIR principle F2. Its raw value is the number of credits obtained in the question, measured on an ordinal scale with the following levels: 0 (The ontology is described with 0 'should or optional' property); 1 (The ontology is described with 1 'should or optional' property); 2 (The ontology is described with 2 'should or optional' properties); 3 (The ontology is described with 3 'should or optional' properties / The ontology is described with 4 'should or optional' properties); 4 (The ontology is described with 5 'should or optional' properties / The ontology is described with 6 or more 'should or optional' properties)."@en ;
