        obo:IAO_0000115  "Are the ontology and its metadata accessible through another standard protocol such as SPARQL? This metric corresponds to the O'FAIRe question A1Q4, which assesses FAIR principle A1. Its raw value is the number of credits obtained in the question, measured on an ordinal scale with the following levels: 0 (The ontology is not accessible through a SPARQL endpoint); 6 (The ontology declares being accessible through a SPARQL endpoint)."@en ;
