        obo:IAO_0000115  "Is the ontology registered in multiple ontology 'libraries'? This metric corresponds to the O'FAIRe question F4Q1, which assesses FAIR principle F4. Its raw value is the number of credits obtained in the question, measured on an ordinal scale with the following levels: 0 (The ontology is registered in 0 ontology library); 2 (The ontology is registered in 1 ontology library); 4 (The ontology is registered in  2 ontology libraries); 6 (The ontology is registered in 3 or more ontology libraries)."@en ;
        obo:IAO_0000119  "O'FAIRe, https://github.com/agroportal/fairness/blob/master/doc/results/FAIR-questions.md"@en ;
